{
  "$schema": "./contract.schema.json",
  "id": "altitude.chip",
  "name": "Chip",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "status": "draft",
  "description": "SEED contract for the ALTITUDE round — props/axes only; anatomy is promoted from captured DOM truth. Subject: altitude-web-components@1.0.2 (published npm, Lit 3, SHADOW DOM), pinned in examples/altitude/.altitude-sandbox (examples/altitude/PROVENANCE.md). EVERY enum in this library is DEFAULTLESS — the default rendering is the ABSENCE of the attribute (there is no `variant=\"primary\"`; primary IS unset), so every axis leads with the `unset` pseudo-value. No `disabled` state plane: Altitude never reaches the `:disabled` pseudo-class from a prop on these components (al-button's isDisabled emits aria-disabled ONLY — measured identical background, cursor and opacity — and the other seven spell it as an `al-is-disabled` class, which is a prop-selected RENDERING, i.e. a variant axis, not a pseudo-class plane). al-chip. `isDismissible` DEFERRED BY NAME: it mounts a nested <al-icon-close> (a second shadow root inside this one) and `close()` mutates the HOST's classList — a depth-2 presence subtree with a self-mutating driver, out of round 1. COMPUTED-ENRICHED (extract/computed): unlabeled styled channels minted from computed-style capture of altitude-web-components@1.0.2 in headless Chromium 149.0.7827.55; overflow channels in the sibling extension file. FLOOR-PROMOTED (examples/altitude/scripts/promote-floor.mjs): enriched.contract.json — computed-capture truth; minted leaves source-aliased to Altitude's own CSS-variable references where verified (source-bindings.json); extension sidecar carries the named overflow.",
  "archetype": "badge / tag / chip",
  "semantics": {
    "element": "button"
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "variant",
      "type": {
        "enum": [
          "secondary",
          "info",
          "success",
          "warning",
          "danger"
        ]
      },
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "VARIANT",
          "property": "Variant",
          "values": {
            "secondary": "Secondary",
            "info": "Info",
            "success": "Success",
            "warning": "Warning",
            "danger": "Danger"
          }
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "variant"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "type",
      "type": {
        "enum": [
          "squared"
        ]
      },
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "VARIANT",
          "property": "Type",
          "values": {
            "squared": "Squared"
          }
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "type"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "children",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "Chip",
      "description": "Promoted from the computed floor: the root renders its children as direct text (captured mount proof).",
      "bindings": {
        "figma": {
          "kind": "TEXT",
          "property": "Content"
        },
        "code": {
          "prop": "children"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
